# The image (gate/Dockerfile) is built from the repo root and takes only what pregate.sh needs
# inside it (F10-R6): the gate package and its Lean metaprograms, and the locked Python
# environment. Everything else — the api, the site, the specs, the venv — stays on the host.
*
!gate/
!.python-version
!lean-toolchain
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
gate/lean/.lake/
gate/lean/lean-toolchain
gate/tests/
gate/.dockerignore
**/__pycache__/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
